{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "ff065edb7ab34895ef91930fd6270382c08c82df85f7510c8d00be4f7756c88c", "ja": "これからも、なんどでも", "zh": "今后无论多少次，也要携手同行", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "7983b6fdb3640687477b574fb6c0be03d486b1408eab6923e4bc557d1329ef02", "ja": "未来達に突然、劇場の客席に呼び出されたプ\nロデューサー。そこには、ステージ衣装でス\nポットライトを浴びる3人の姿が。大切な場\n所から、最初のファンへと語られる感謝の言\n葉。そして、特別公演の幕が開く……。", "zh": "制作人被未来等人突然叫到了剧场的观众席。那\n里，有3人身穿舞台服装，沐浴在聚\n光灯下。从重要的地方，向最初的粉丝诉说感\n谢的话语。然后，特别公演拉开帷幕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "07cc6b3d0efea37f8c79e0a2825e92a9ca9945dc2e4196585473736206121cde", "ja": "（PRライブが近づいたある日、未来から\n「客席に来てください」と連絡があった）", "zh": "（PR演出临近的一天，未来突然联系我，说“请到观众席来”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "13132f83ce80b6c7dd01e84becd65e25b5da890cfded4183387091697071c958", "ja": "（どういうことだ？　まあ、行ってみるか……）", "zh": "（这是怎么回事？算了，去看看吧……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "fe382ea3cabe060bbc6cdd16ccea10e9f75de8d544309cf4469ffbc37e5b7043", "ja": "あれっ？　照明が落ちてる。\nさっきまで点いてたはずだけど……。", "zh": "咦？灯灭了。\n刚才应该还开着的啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1004_014mir", "source_sha256": "e54811fe30306ee54a0ae0138dd484e99644afcc768f01c303575cb3832882d1", "ja": "{$P$}さーん！", "zh": "{$P$}先生～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1005_p", "source_sha256": "176e30c1a3929494c036d42e5f8153906770f70a437e17aa677e0a4095a00450", "ja": "未来！　静香、翼……！\nその衣装……。", "zh": "未来！静香、翼……！\n那套服装……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "f39b1a0b603888be38fab83b12c904902a1b959717a913501fc1ba5ecf2bca34", "ja": "突然呼び出して、ごめんなさい！　私たち、\n{$P$}さんに言いたいことがあって。", "zh": "突然把你们叫来，对不起！我们有些话想对{$P$}先生说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "263ad94b8180c6ed867a3934c6b9bbf4e289612b97e5451062fd68113b05d045", "ja": "それで、わたし達はアイドルだから。\n伝えたいことはステージで、ってことになりました♪", "zh": "所以，我们是偶像嘛。\n于是就决定要把想传达的话放到舞台上来说♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "1e4176d001aaf8c91c1f8651a319e22af6369dd6d5058d666bd80875fd7e6068", "ja": "まあ、MCの練習みたいなものです。\nしっかり聞いてくださいね。一度しか言いませんから！", "zh": "嗯，就当作是MC的练习吧。\n请认真听好了。我只说一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1009_p", "source_sha256": "38ae2876ecf7f1ad4ef2a3573f6003a8a36e774d0ffb725717a85c1587390c23", "ja": "そうか。練習なのに、なぜ一度しか……\nいや、わかった。とにかく聞かせてもらうよ。", "zh": "这样啊。明明是在练习，为什么只说一遍……\n算了，我明白了。总之，你说给我听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "e0dab39f1adcb9920f0729cbc6bfda7578efc36c37189939e8ad1e11a1be06fd", "ja": "えっと……今回のレッスン期間中に、\n私たちは今までのことを、たくさん話しました。", "zh": "那个……这次的课程期间，\n我们聊了很多以前的事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "3e6dcb06c41ebba11c2cc6827a9db9c8de4e495c6ddff1bb2ff4f575de280a5d", "ja": "仲間もいっぱいサポートしてくれて、助かりました。\nでも助けてくれるのは、今回だけじゃありません。", "zh": "队友们也一直在支持我，真的帮了大忙。\n但帮助我的并不只有这一次。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1012_015siz", "source_sha256": "0556e8654a7c88627d3491f3bf556ad42f0bee58fc4657ae06c02c30ec902569", "ja": "いつもみんなが、私を……私たちを支えてくれる。\nそれがすごく嬉しくて、とても心強かったです。", "zh": "大家总是支撑着我……支撑着我们。\n这让我感到非常高兴，心里也踏实了许多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "aae8c31a47bb767589eb3efc8e6e15d495d106e8b904bb660af4504f6d0af029", "ja": "わたし、アイドルになって毎日が楽しいです♪\nレッスンは、まだちょっと苦手ですけど……。", "zh": "我成为偶像后，每天都过得很开心♪  \n虽然我还是有点不擅长训练……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "277f78b9956782666c03c34f901a15148cd81052277d67fdf5fdf4f569a432db", "ja": "でもファンの人たちに応援してもらえると嬉しいし、\nみんなと一緒に歌うのも踊るのも、すっごく楽しい！", "zh": "不过，能得到粉丝们的支持，我就很开心，而且和大家一起唱歌、跳舞，也特别开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cabce8de7b2af9b2a19d3312754fccd1e0fcfaf434abdad56db4638614b77159", "ja": "だからわたし、劇場がとっても大好きです。\n{$P$}さんがいる、劇場が大好き！", "zh": "所以我特别喜欢剧场。\n我最喜欢有{$P$}先生在的剧场！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1016_014mir", "source_sha256": "33b2092b1aad977def8eb54943329316c323c251eeb597e5ed8958246cbeec28", "ja": "私たちはみんな、ここから始まりました。先輩たちが\nいて、みんながいて、たくさんの笑顔があって……。", "zh": "我们大家，都是从这里出发的。有前辈们在，有大家在，有那么多灿烂的笑容……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "95ac5124a5e090b248646e77b76dd04ddb543e8cb1d83e1d0965b8b5c50befe4", "ja": "これから先、どんなステージで歌うことがあっても、\n劇場はずっと、私たちの大切な場所です！", "zh": "今后无论要登上怎样的舞台，剧场永远都是我们珍贵的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1018_014mir", "source_sha256": "e128ee2f1f5ac779dd9e7d4022d655c86d784ffbda870f64b6c473f73d650cfb", "ja": "そして……そんな大切な劇場と、仲間をくれた、\n{$P$}さん！　せーのっ……。", "zh": "还有……给予我们如此重要的剧场和伙伴的，\n{$P$}先生！一、二……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1019_014mir", "source_sha256": "ae38a7cbf2ea634607233496be1722995938ebd9807fa8b754f9b070b0be7e39", "ja": "ありがとうございまーすっ！", "zh": "非常感谢——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "e7e8266a78304c6acc523897738228ba5aeafedf9dbc31f8042cd8b7897ef1e8", "ja": "ありがとうございます！", "zh": "谢谢你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1021_016tsu", "source_sha256": "74d2e52daca66f81a2a48ce5127d8ccdf6f3681d65c34c72979005b7ca7f3885", "ja": "ありがとうございま～す♪", "zh": "谢谢啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1022_p", "source_sha256": "2381d4673c322191af53156312b3234ef7ddd9973356f85160e2db3cd57cc665", "ja": "……。ありがとう。突然で驚いたけど、嬉しいよ。\nただ、わかってるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "……。谢谢你们。虽然很突然吓了一跳，但我挺开心的。\n不过，我想你们应该也明白……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1023_p", "source_sha256": "8fd2fa9e5ff977d721f0a77f853e28fbebf4e27bd890fe8751768e2df10ccf1a", "ja": "お前たちはアイドルだ。お礼を言う相手を間違えてる\nようじゃ、MCの練習としては落第点だぞ？", "zh": "你们可是偶像。要是连该向谁道谢都弄错了，\n作为MC练习来说可就是不及格了哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1024_014mir", "source_sha256": "deee2d7ad22e674639f8b89d4e6916c3414a7db4569871f0402642268645cf66", "ja": "もちろん、感謝の気持ちはファンの人達にもたくさん\n届けます！　いっぱい、「ありがとー」って伝えます！", "zh": "当然也要把这份感谢传达给粉丝们！要好多好多次地对他们说“谢谢——”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1025_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a75cdbcd0d07adf164cd103698e1ea50131910305178ac41e6f69a9b6c2ced1a", "ja": "でもその前に、最初に{$P$}さんに\n聞いてほしかったの。わたし達の、今の気持ち！", "zh": "不过在那之前，我想先让{$P$}先生听听！听听我们现在的心情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1026_015siz", "source_sha256": "2ba7a4ec58bee8edbfa6d2242ff9cd77b666aaccaffd17412bb7b8130d2b3c14", "ja": "それに……私、聞いたことがあるんです。その……\nプロデューサーは、アイドルの一人目のファンだって！", "zh": "而且……我还听说过，那就是……\n制作人是偶像的第一位粉丝！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_1027", "source_sha256": "cfadf8d6d3a4623a661d7291915869c05a07c1d3f3c6f24d102345b2ee830c68", "ja": "……その通り", "zh": "……正是如此", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2000_p", "source_sha256": "f5d32efb103359d0c70642765b3d2764a24a1900b24c543efa5705564c7d6406", "ja": "なるほど……うん、その通りだ。アイドルから\n最初のファンへのメッセージ、確かに受け取ったよ！", "zh": "原来如此……嗯，确实如此。我确实收到了偶像们送给最初粉丝的留言！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2001_014mir", "source_sha256": "01ef4346e82b2c86c60c5b866704d8c7cf0a35672eba1378b09f2a8b5c43508b", "ja": "はい！　{$P$}さん……\n私達をアイドルにしてくれて、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "是的！　{$P$}先生……\n谢谢您让我们成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2002_015siz", "source_sha256": "0bceda58d631b56c57298071c829d87f62c1171615acf8626acd00512391ae0f", "ja": "私達は、これからもずっとアイドルでいます。\n{$P$}と一緒に！", "zh": "我们今后也会一直当偶像。和{$P$}一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "98313e412c9c97efe05a868976bafd00add35949c7572e0b6f999abafad0ce14", "ja": "きっとどんどん、かわいくなっちゃいますよ～。\nだから……、これからも、目を離さないでくださいね♪", "zh": "一定会变得越来越可爱哦～  \n所以……今后也请不要移开视线哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2004_p", "source_sha256": "1cce942ee9e043cc9881effbbd1e5008c90ea8acc1029da540a89c40ed824591", "ja": "未来、静香、翼……ありがとう。\nこちらこそ、アイドルになってくれてありがとうな！", "zh": "未来、静香、翼……谢谢你们。\n该说谢谢的是我，谢谢你们成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2005_014mir", "source_sha256": "ff6d1707dd05a2a2f89621936361965c3ae481960e3677de7b73ea1fc56baa0d", "ja": "はい♪\nそれでは……本番のPRライブで歌う前に！", "zh": "好的♪\n那么……在正式的宣传演唱会开始前！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0166_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0166_story_06_2006_015siz", "source_sha256": "164dbb88a673c106bf5e6109b91c7070cde9a9822e7c15fd05901e8485e5e7e8", "ja": "最初のファンになってくれた人のための、\n特別公演を開催します。", "zh": "为了成为我第一位粉丝的你，\n我要举办一场特别公演。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
